WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:06,600
Is there any place where I can get more than six bottles of energy boxes?

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,000
You ate all the boxes of six and seven bottles

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Two groups of camps were also prepared

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,200
All that's left are the corpses

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,120
Forget about the corpse

6
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,720
It doesn't do much good if you eat it.

7
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:19,010
Time to find the queen

8
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:21,720
when to leave

9
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,920
I'll let Tang Lang deliver it

10
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,320
I'll take you to see the queen myself

11
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,300
So considerate

12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,200
I can’t bear to leave you anymore. Let’s go.

13
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,600
Let's set off now

14
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,970
rest for two days

15
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:37,770
Let’s talk about you, General Tangtang.

16
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:39,370
How could you leave the camp without permission?

17
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,000
Don't rest

18
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,400
good stuff

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,200
Better than energy box

20
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,050
There will be variables as we wait.

21
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,290
You've suffered a big loss

22
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:50,890
I'm just about to report the results

23
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,600
No problem if I leave for ten days and a half

24
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,600
Makes sense

25
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,240
Then let's go

26
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,840
It's not far ahead

27
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,240
The queen has become

28
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,440
Extremely prosperous

29
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:08,160
How about Lively Feifan?

30
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:12,540
Bear tail, this is okay

31
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:14,340
Have you ever seen the world?

32
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:16,230
This is okay

33
00:01:16,230 --> 00:01:18,030
The red tail is indeed spectacular

34
00:01:18,030 --> 00:01:20,030
It blinded me

35
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:22,030
This is right, leave it alone

36
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:23,830
Flying over Ducheng is not allowed
